This directory contains the project's native and hardware-facing regression tests.

Native tests exercise CAN frame parsing, counters, checksums, safety gates, plugin
rules, driver recovery, dashboard handlers, and bounded diagnostics without
transmitting on a vehicle bus. PlatformIO Test Runner builds and runs these tests.

Run the focused Python tests from the repository root:

```bash
python3 -m unittest discover -s test -p 'test_*.py'
```

Run the configured native environments with the command documented by the
repository instructions. Firmware builds and vehicle testing are separate steps;
passing unit tests does not prove a CAN change is safe on a car.

PlatformIO reference: https://docs.platformio.org/en/latest/advanced/unit-testing/index.html
